---
const home = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <title>Página no encontrada · Page not found · Page introuvable · Страница не найдена</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: dark;
        font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
        background: #11110f;
        color: #f7f4e8;
      }
      body {
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 1rem;
      }
      main {
        max-width: 36rem;
        border: 1px solid #665900;
        border-radius: 1rem;
        padding: 2rem;
        text-align: center;
      }
      a {
        color: #f0d000;
      }
      a:focus-visible {
        outline: 3px solid #f0d000;
        outline-offset: 4px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <p>404</p>
      <h1>Página no encontrada · Page not found · Page introuvable · Страница не найдена</h1>
      <p>This path has not been written into the Legacy.</p>
      <p lang="es">Esta página aún no se ha escrito en Legacy.</p>
      <p lang="fr">Ce chemin n'a pas encore été inscrit dans la Legacy.</p>
      <p lang="ru">Эта страница ещё не вписана в Legacy.</p>
      <p>
        <a href={home}>English · Español · Français · Русский</a>
      </p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
